        ]
      ],
      "id": "nsrx1rz"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5xtajlw",
      "content": "• The State Legislature consists of the Governor and one or two houses."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "buwr5r1",
      "content": "• States may have unicameral or bicameral legislature."
    },
    {
      "id": "y7kvcfl",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "6. Legislative Assembly (Vidhan Sabha)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "7macuig",
      "content": "• Lower house of state legislature."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "2jriavx",
      "content": "• Members directly elected by people."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "epj3w1g",
      "content": "• Normal term is 5 years."
    },
    {
      "id": "u8bvks7",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "7. Legislative Council (Vidhan Parishad)"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "1ugjaa1",
      "content": "• Upper house in some states."
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Questions frequently test constitutional articles associated with the appointment and powers of the Governor and Chief Minister.",
        "Understand the structural differences between Vidhan Sabha (Legislative Assembly) and Vidhan Parishad (Legislative Council)."
      ],
      "id": "qcy5v1w"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "6aa1juz",
      "content": "• It is a permanent body."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "poywz0s",
      "content": "• One-third members retire every two years."
    },
    {
      "id": "jofaje2",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "BANKING  / BANKING  Important Facts"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "0jkkgg2",
      "content": "• Part VI deals with State Government."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "plknqm5",
      "content": "• Governor is constitutional head."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "79axuyv",
      "content": "• Chief Minister is real executive head."
    }
  ],
